[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 6248.39, "timestamp": "01:44:08", "text": "如果你到处都能看到我，那你可能就认识我了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6250.47, "timestamp": "01:44:10", "text": "是的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6253.83, "timestamp": "01:44:13", "text": "我想我在……（此处原文疑似拼写错误，无法翻译）"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6255.43, "timestamp": "01:44:15", "text": "渠道。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6259.75, "timestamp": "01:44:19", "text": "如果我没记错的话，这是灵魂对话。坚持，稍等。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6261.99, "timestamp": "01:44:21", "text": "精神状态如何？已经有一段时间了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6265.189, "timestamp": "01:44:25", "text": "我和他谈过了。我确实看到了通知"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6268.229, "timestamp": "01:44:28", "text": "他的溪流。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6271.03, "timestamp": "01:44:31", "text": "我看到了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6281.59, "timestamp": "01:44:41", "text": "好的，保存一下。还有什么其他问题？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6283.669, "timestamp": "01:44:43", "text": "页脚必须是一个对象。现在，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6285.59, "timestamp": "01:44:45", "text": "您的嵌入正文看起来像这样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6289.03, "timestamp": "01:44:49", "text": "这。添加密钥。"}]